* =================================================================
* LAYER 2 (circuit features): 64x5 Differential 1T1R ReRAM Crossbar
* Technology: SKY130 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 + ReRAM PDK (behavioral sinh I-V)
* ReRAM model: sky130_fd_pr_reram__reram_cell (I_k1=6.14e-05, V_ref=0.43)
* =================================================================
*
* Conductance range: 0.296 - 99.273 uS (SKY130 ReRAM PDK)
* Tfilament range: 3.3 - 4.9 nm
* V_READ = 0.15V, V_GATE = 1.8V
* Scale factor: 2.239601e+05
* Total 1T1R cells: 640 (differential)
*
* Biases (add after current sensing):
*   b[0] = 0.039583
*   b[1] = 0.221185
*   b[2] = -0.391355
*   b[3] = -0.450722
*   b[4] = -0.840526
* =================================================================
* Column readout: NFET diode W=50.0u L=1.0u + col_readout subcircuit
* V_row offset: +0.52V (compensates NFET diode column voltage)

